// Title: Suspicious MacOS Firmware Activity
// Rule ID: 7ed2c9f7-c59d-4c82-a7e2-f859aa676099
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.impact
// Category: process_creation
// Product: macos
// Pipeline: azure_monitor
